{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさーん♪\n雨続きの天気でうんざり\nしてませんかー？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかく整えた髪が\n外に出た瞬間グシャってなったり\n湿気で肌がペタペタしたり_(┐「ε:)_"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなモヤモヤもまなったんblogで\n吹っ飛ばしてやりたいと思います( +･`ｰ･´)ﾄﾞﾔｯ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/06/22/6886360/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前のコメントに握手会の\n衣装リクエストが結構あったから\n参考にしてみまーす(*`･ω･´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんいつもコメント\nありがとうね∩^ω^∩♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日はある撮影を\nしてきました〜(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもと違った雰囲気の\n撮影でドキドキしてたんだけど\n楽しかったなぁ(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああいう撮影も今後\n増えていったら嬉しいです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っっていっても何のこと\n言ってんだよまなったん！\nてなってる？_(┐「ε:)_"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また後日ここに書くから\nみなさんいい子にして\n待っててくだちゃいねー♡(人-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃっ♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/06/22/6886360/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばね、\n実は一昨日で19歳があと2ヶ月を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"切ってしまったのです(´°ω°｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はやーいっ(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう19年生きたのかぁ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんとこうやってブログを\n通してコミュニケーション\n取ったり、握手会でたくさん\nぎゅ〜ってしたりしながら\n今を迎えられて本当に幸せですっヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日々楽しんでます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てことで20歳になったら\n1番初めになにをしようか\n考えてるヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/06/22/6886360/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃ、まなったんとおしゃべりtime(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ね、この↑まなったんとおしゃべりtime(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ♡ってネーミングをメンバーにいじられる(-ω-；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっへんっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気を取り直して行きましょー♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qまなったんが最近ハマってることや集めてるものある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aハマってることはメンバーの\nブログを読むこと〜♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"集めてるのは..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ルームウエア集めと\n旅行の雑誌集めをしてる♪\nことりっぷとかを見て\n旅行気分を味わってます(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いま一番行きたいのは\n北海道と沖縄Σ(σ`･ω･´)σ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"弾丸ツアーでもいいから\n行きたい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qまなったんって泳ぐのは得意だったりするの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A昔から背泳ぎだけ出来るのっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、でも犬かきが1番得意！\nワンちゃんと競ってみたい(･▽･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qまなつのお母さんってどんな感じなのかな？真夏みたいにポワッっとしてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"B見た目も中身もすごい似てるって\nいろんな方に言われる（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"動きも似てるらしいよ(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q漫才するなら誰と組みたい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A真夏がボケならツッコミは若月♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、真夏がツッコミなら\nボケはまあやだな♪♪｀‐ω‐´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやの素でボケボケな感じは\nほんとかわいいヽ(｡･∀･)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後のひなちゃんとかも\nツッコミ向いてると思うっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんな可愛い顔してかずみんに\nズバッと言うとこ好きだなぁ♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/06/22/6886360/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日ね、弟のパーカーを\n勝手に着てきたの(｀・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイズデカーイヾ(-ω-*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃっ♪またね(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ♡"}],"source":"archive"}